<title>UK: TABLE TENNIS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE TENNIS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of the penultimate day of the world table tennis championships on Sunday (prefix numbers denote seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles quarter-finals</p>
<p>2-Jan-Ove Waldner (Sweden) beat 9/16-Jean-Philippe Gatien (France) 21-7 22-20 21-14</p>
<p>Yan Sen (China) beat He Zhi Wen (Spain) 21-19 19-21 21-13 21-19 1-Kong Linghui (China) beat 9/16-Ma Wenge (China) 16-21 22-20 14-21 21-15 21-12</p>
<p>3/4-Vladimir Samsonov (Belarus) beat 5/8-Ding Song (China) 21-13 21-9 21-10</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinals</p>
<p>Waldner beat Yan 21-17 21-14 21-12</p>
<p>Samsonov beat Kong 21-15 21-18 17-21 21-17</p>
<p>Final: Samsonov v Waldner, Monday (1700 GMT)</p>
<p>Women's singles quarter-finals</p>
<p>5/8-Wang Nan (China) beat Cheng Hongxia (China) 21-18 22-20 18-21 21-9</p>
<p>9/16-Wu Na (China) beat 9/16-Nicole Struse (Germany) 21-16 21-13 21-18</p>
<p>1-Deng Yaping (China) beat Wong Ching (China) 21-14 21-15 19-21 21-10</p>
<p>3/4-Li Ju (China) beat 9/16-Qiao Yungping (China) 21-12 21-17 21-16</p>
<p>Women's semifinals</p>
<p>Wang beat Wu 29-31 21-10 21-16 21-15</p>
<p>Deng beat Li 21-12 21-19 21-7</p>
<p>Final: Deng v Wang, Monday (1330 GMT)</p>
<p>Mixed doubles semifinals</p>
<p>1-Kong Linghui/Deng Yaping (China) beat 9/16-Chiang Peng-lung/Chen Jing (Taiwan) 21-16 21-16 15-21 21-7</p>
<p>2-Liu Guoliang/Wu Na (China) beat Wang Liqin/Wang Nan (China) 20-22 21-15 21-17 21-9.</p>
<p>Mixed doubles final</p>
<p>Liu/Wu beat Kong/Deng 21-12 22-20 19-21 21-11</p>
<p>Men's doubles quarter-finals</p>
<p>5/8-Koji Matsushita/Hiroshi Shibutani (Japan) beat 3/4-Wang Tao/Ma Lin (China) 21-15 21-19 21-15</p>
<p>2-Jan-Ove Waldner/Jorgen Persson (Sweden) beat 9/16-Werner Schlager/Karl Jindrak (Austria) 19-21 21-19 27-25 21-16</p>
<p>1-Kong Linghui/Liu Guoliang (China) beat 5/8-Vladimir Samsonov (Belarus)/Joerg Rosskopf (Germany) 17-21 21-12 21-13 21-10</p>
<p>5/8-Jean-Philippe Gatien/Damien Eloi (France) beat 3/4-Yan Sen/Wang Liqin (China) 21-10 21-10 12-21 22-20.</p>
<p>Women's doubles quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Deng Yaping/Yang Ying (China) beat 9/16-Chen Jing/Chen Chiu-tan (Taiwan) 21-16 21-7 21-10</p>
<p>3/4-Qiao Yungping (China)/Chai Po Wa (Hong Kong) beat 5/8-Wang Chen/Wu Na (China) 21-10 21-12 21-11</p>
<p>Wang Hui/Cheng Hongxia (China) beat Otilia Badescu/Emilia Ciosu (Romania) 21-17 21-9 21-16</p>
<p>3/4-Li Ju/Wang Nan (China) beat Ai Sakata/Yuki Takakusa (Japan) 21-9 21-15 21-15.</p>
</text>
